  "limitations": [
    "Historical indicators, not predictions and not a trained destination-stress model.",
    "No occupancy, occupied/available accommodation capacity, crowd density or ecological carrying-capacity labels exist in this panel.",
    "PM2.5 is modeled national population-weighted exposure; water stress is FAO national freshwater withdrawal/resource context. Neither isolates tourism impacts.",
    "Environmental indicators are national only: no allocation to individual states or destinations, and no causal tourism-pollution claim.",
    "Visits may repeat persons, source totals include estimates and revisions, and rounded state units differ from exact printed national totals.",
